{"en": "260931593", "title": "PARTIE 1 : NAVIGUER DANS OpenELIS GLOBAL", "adf": {"type": "doc", "content": [{"type": "extension", "attrs": {"layout": "default", "extensionType": "com.atlassian.confluence.macro.core", "extensionKey": "toc", "parameters": {"macroParams": {"style": {"value": "none"}}, "macroMetadata": {"macroId": {"value": "368d2d86-3413-4ad3-9845-6b3322d9ed16"}, "schemaVersion": {"value": "1"}, "title": "Table of Contents"}}}}, {"type": "heading", "attrs": {"level": 1}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Introduction", "marks": [{"type": "strong"}]}]}, {"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Le système OpenELIS Global se compose de plusieurs écrans et flux de travail concis qui facilitent la collecte, la gestion et la communication des données de laboratoire. Ce système vise à offrir une approche structurée de la gestion des données dans le laboratoire clinique, afin de garantir des processus d'analyse et des résultats de haute qualité, ensuite rendus accessibles aux systèmes et aux personnes externes dans les flux de travail cliniques, populationnels et programmatiques de la santé."}]}, {"type": "heading", "attrs": {"level": 2}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "How to login to OpenELIS", "marks": [{"type": "strong"}]}]}, {"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Pour vous connecter à OpenELIS, vous aurez besoin d'un"}, {"type": "text", "text": " Nom d'utilisateur", "marks": [{"type": "strong"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " et d'un"}, {"type": "text", "text": " Mot de passe", "marks": [{"type": "strong"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " fournis par l'administrateur de votre instance OpenELIS. "}]}, {"type": "orderedList", "attrs": {"order": 1}, "content": [{"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Saisissez votre "}, {"type": "text", "text": "Nom d'utilisateur", "marks": [{"type": "strong"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " et votre "}, {"type": "text", "text": "Mot de passe", "marks": [{"type": "strong"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " puis cliquez sur le bouton"}, {"type": "text", "text": " Soumettre", "marks": [{"type": "strong"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": "."}]}]}]}, {"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Notice", "marks": [{"type": "strong"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " : l'accès à ce service est réservé au personnel autorisé. Si vous n'avez pas l'autorisation expresse de l'administrateur, vous devez quitter immédiatement. Cette organisation interdit tout accès, divulgation, reproduction, modification, détournement, destruction, perte, utilisation abusive ou vol non autorisés de ses informations."}]}, {"type": "mediaSingle", "attrs": {"layout": "wide", "width": 800, "widthType": "pixel"}, "content": [{"type": "media", "attrs": {"width": 1366, "type": "external", "url": "https://lh7-rt.googleusercontent.com/docsz/AD_4nXeA6x4y7aiVpZD19B63GI3lqz2z4QCJTmzMiFkSKJL2By2rRJs5lNfDll8x0zLdg3DnDrPEyYlSsDxtG4Neo8cf3BYKDob2Jx13Ho83qkWpVROgKJntWvZQ53tTL5p6Kpq4vtLSqQasOPf_gwOd24inwUQ?key=RdnqcmhphzNc1dIKCApPKg", "height": 699}}, {"type": "caption", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Page de connexion d'OpenELIS Global 3.0", "marks": [{"type": "em"}]}]}]}, {"type": "paragraph"}, {"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Une fois connecté à OpenELIS Global, la page d'accueil affiche les statistiques de gestion du laboratoire pour vous permettre de connaître l'état actuel des processus d'analyse. "}]}, {"type": "mediaSingle", "attrs": {"layout": "wide", "width": 800, "widthType": "pixel"}, "content": [{"type": "media", "attrs": {"width": 1600, "type": "external", "url": "https://lh7-rt.googleusercontent.com/docsz/AD_4nXc4UxlvCbTN92e1iaEszyH1PFhw8ExxqLRkXA73yQi_7OMsv4BmNqqdZJzea1FwdDu3IutZpHUzlxyFP-CnGnqBTKm-4i3uiMb2j_xdoQThkDyC-uj2nQCjx-N5k6xrgJ7QGGdMh10_cooVN58rKE3rOO8?key=RdnqcmhphzNc1dIKCApPKg", "height": 826}}, {"type": "caption", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Statistiques OpenELIS", "marks": [{"type": "em"}]}]}]}, {"type": "heading", "attrs": {"level": 2}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "How to change the language on OpenELIS", "marks": [{"type": "strong"}]}]}, {"type": "orderedList", "attrs": {"order": 1}, "content": [{"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Placez la souris dans le coin supérieur droit et cliquez sur l'icône de profil  "}]}]}]}, {"type": "mediaSingle", "attrs": {"layout": "wide", "width": 800, "widthType": "pixel"}, "content": [{"type": "media", "attrs": {"width": 1600, "type": "external", "url": "https://lh7-rt.googleusercontent.com/docsz/AD_4nXd6aw0rZRB3qmT3ti-4F4pd8dImWY19EW7RfDWXf00wwRSwuRl7NL2wI-GjZ7XyYXQdpv_FsYFNzexlay6WWSzevYoY1X3MadbkzF_2bbhwGel4YPrCIGBUIbyOa7eDcYOKuL9h2C9osL8zvaxn0LpCk4-_?key=RdnqcmhphzNc1dIKCApPKg", "height": 826}}, {"type": "caption", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Accès aux préférences de langue", "marks": [{"type": "em"}]}]}]}, {"type": "orderedList", "attrs": {"order": 2}, "content": [{"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Pour passer de l'anglais au français, cliquez sur le menu déroulant. "}]}]}]}, {"type": "mediaSingle", "attrs": {"layout": "wide", "width": 800, "widthType": "pixel"}, "content": [{"type": "media", "attrs": {"width": 1600, "type": "external", "url": "https://lh7-rt.googleusercontent.com/docsz/AD_4nXeNmnpoe17BQJOBstVKAh9HRJQJLuCayDYuE4PPelDAYiK4S1Krzbglsu2OzXUqmokdV2x-1p6F3EXIXgftsXW7emUo5l3u9Cag_F6kNyhbcdJcJQpL58y7uhYwOYiZH-DL1dYfrzpjh_8ExexN7vcEOOiZ?key=RdnqcmhphzNc1dIKCApPKg", "height": 803}}, {"type": "caption", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Menu déroulant des langues", "marks": [{"type": "em"}]}]}]}, {"type": "orderedList", "attrs": {"order": 3}, "content": [{"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Placez la souris sur Français et cliquez"}]}]}]}, {"type": "mediaSingle", "attrs": {"layout": "wide", "width": 800, "widthType": "pixel"}, "content": [{"type": "media", "attrs": {"width": 1600, "type": "external", "url": "https://lh7-rt.googleusercontent.com/docsz/AD_4nXcVChrlOW3vEdNTU3GSaSVEp8IXGPh1VvREl3RmZlgzUKRmFjR5JrRT3xjlRGr2nv4QF0oFGJ7PornEbp1QZK3SX1JOw91c1cmFIr3YP0ulWsjRFqr3k22HQiPSuwKWfXtv_QjNt_QGMkD_Fkh_52Z9n1A_?key=RdnqcmhphzNc1dIKCApPKg", "height": 803}}, {"type": "caption", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Changer de langue ", "marks": [{"type": "em"}]}]}]}, {"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "La langue par défaut passera de l'anglais au français"}]}, {"type": "paragraph"}, {"type": "mediaSingle", "attrs": {"layout": "wide", "width": 800, "widthType": "pixel"}, "content": [{"type": "media", "attrs": {"width": 1600, "type": "external", "url": "https://lh7-rt.googleusercontent.com/docsz/AD_4nXfemVh67Ovsl3ATb3nS0D6o7OLxcUToIQqJ-XhJ9LSi3-0MJOaHrD1yf17-eFVEkMyuOb2au2T8vR5nNVVzYkv3W87ab8qH9nlQboyV7P8hfi_Srm0m7QTf8ZiuWhoIXHVnUgglKeSowoXD814iNyu6ckqe?key=RdnqcmhphzNc1dIKCApPKg", "height": 918}}, {"type": "caption", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Changement de langue ", "marks": [{"type": "em"}]}]}]}, {"type": "heading", "attrs": {"level": 2}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "How to access the OpenELIS menu", "marks": [{"type": "strong"}]}]}, {"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Pour accéder au menu principal, cliquez sur l'icône de menu en haut à gauche de l'écran."}]}, {"type": "mediaSingle", "attrs": {"layout": "wide", "width": 800, "widthType": "pixel"}, "content": [{"type": "media", "attrs": {"width": 1366, "type": "external", "url": "https://lh7-rt.googleusercontent.com/docsz/AD_4nXcNN4Y08Pr1HTY92qmFnBYCjdhjKjHdczQJnz0HKLW05-AtZmcsQ5vgR4ncao9VmIhUG-gH8gydRrJY82IK0wRioijuoEYL4z3EsFrCnqhP283hvHq5KQ7b3jr07-8zShA22l9RPvm3y-nfrotfwgqQBbKc?key=RdnqcmhphzNc1dIKCApPKg", "height": 699}}, {"type": "caption", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Accès au menu d'OpenELIS 3", "marks": [{"type": "em"}]}]}]}, {"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Après un clic sur l'icône de menu, le menu OpenELIS s'affiche sur le côté gauche de l'écran, avec des modules qui reflètent les principales activités du flux de travail du laboratoire. Le bouton d'annulation ferme le menu latéral."}]}, {"type": "mediaSingle", "attrs": {"layout": "wide", "width": 800, "widthType": "pixel"}, "content": [{"type": "media", "attrs": {"width": 1600, "type": "external", "url": "https://lh7-rt.googleusercontent.com/docsz/AD_4nXe_psGZuQEiFRcsgyWIJsbNgucDMiLbUlC7VmE8lJktXAOcq3FuUV_3-iWv_qjB2R1XsZt6-qobI-XGrOa3ZHHcVzI4cFcpw4gdZeTY9UxCSLHArrxllOCdJVa9Wncgq_X0Tu9FmeCce5tJxUiAfqkmZYc?key=RdnqcmhphzNc1dIKCApPKg", "height": 491}}, {"type": "caption", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Menu d'OpenELIS Global version 3 ", "marks": [{"type": "em"}]}]}]}, {"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Les modules sont présentés dans l'ordre du flux de travail du laboratoire. Le menu principal reste toujours sur la page et vous pouvez naviguer vers d'autres modules selon les besoins de votre travail. "}]}, {"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Les modules sont : "}]}, {"type": "orderedList", "attrs": {"order": 1}, "content": [{"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Commande "}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Patiente "}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": " Événements non conformes "}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Plan de Travail"}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Pathologie"}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Immuno-Histochimie"}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Cytologie"}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Résultats"}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Validation"}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Rapports"}]}]}]}, {"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Les modules supplémentaires comprennent"}]}, {"type": "orderedList", "attrs": {"order": 1}, "content": [{"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Administration", "marks": [{"type": "link", "attrs": {"href": "https://uwdigi.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/oeg/pages/260931593"}}]}]}, {"type": "orderedList", "attrs": {"order": 1}, "content": [{"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": " Informations sur le logiciel et sa configuration "}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": " Menus de configuration des différentes parties du système"}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Menus de gestion des utilisateurs"}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Menus de gestion du catalogue de tests"}]}]}]}]}]}, {"type": "paragraph"}], "version": 1}}